    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22457" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλωττ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>glottis, mouth of the windpipe</i>, <i><span class="en">
